        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rod Lurie, Douchan Gersi\n- Roles: director, screenwriter, film critic, adventurer, documentary filmmaker, author, actor, producer\n- Organizations: PBS\n- Products: Explore\n\nFacts:\n- Rod Lurie was born on May 15, 1962.\n- Rod Lurie is an Israeli-American director, screenwriter, and former film critic.\n- Douchan Gersi was born in 1947 and died in 2015.\n- Douchan Gersi was Slovak-born, Belgium-raised, and Bali-based.\n- Douchan Gersi was an adventurer, documentary filmmaker, author, actor, and producer.\n- Douchan Gersi produced and starred with James Coburn in Explore, a PBS mini-series.",
